      "title": "PARKHOTELS: Upcoming Results And Dividend Will Support Positive Long Term Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Apeejay Surrendra Park Hotels from ₹191 to ₹161, citing updated assumptions around the discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E. What's in the News Apeejay Surrendra Park Hotels has a board meeting scheduled for May 26, 2026 to review and approve audited standalone and consolidated financial results for Q4 and the full year ended March 31, 2026, and to consider a dividend on equity shares for the 2025-26 financial year.",
