      "date": "2026-06-02T12:18:08.000Z",
      "title": "Consensus EPS estimates fall by 20%",
      "body": "The consensus outlook for earnings per share (EPS) in fiscal year 2027 has deteriorated. 2027 revenue forecast decreased from ₹8.43b to ₹8.25b. EPS estimate also fell from ₹6.60 per share to ₹5.25 per share. Net income forecast to grow 73% next year vs 37% growth forecast for Hospitality industry in India. Consensus price target down from ₹191 to ₹161. Share price fell 5.6% to ₹116 over the past week.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
